==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|fi}} {{m|fiu-fin-pro|*pöörä}}, from {{etyl|fiu-pro|fi}} {{m|urj-pro|*peŋerä}}.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[wheel]].
# A [[caster]] (wheeled assembly).
# A [[bicycle]], bike; short for [[polkupyörä]].
# A [[motorcycle]], [[bike]]; short for [[moottoripyörä]].

